{"schema_version":"genshin-world-lore-card-v1","lore_id":"natlan_geography","name_zh":"纳塔主要地理区域","name_en":"Major Regions of Natlan","aliases":["纳塔主要地理区域","Major Regions of Natlan"],"category":"geography","scope":"regional","regions":["Natlan"],"summary":"纳塔位于须弥沙漠以西，地貌包含峡谷、山地、温泉水域、火山、海崖、古城遗址及沿海度假区域。现有证据列出十个主要区域：万火之瓯、坚岩隘谷、踞石山、涌流地、翘枝崖、奥奇卡纳塔、安饶之野、远古圣山、Tezcatepetonco Range与Easybreeze Holiday Resort。","canonical_facts":[{"fact_id":"natgeo_fact_001","text":"纳塔位于须弥大赤沙海西侧、哈德拉玛沙漠以西；当地的火山活动形成了天然温泉。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_natlan_geography_02"]},{"fact_id":"natgeo_fact_002","text":"纳塔的主要区域清单包括：万火之瓯（Basin of Unnumbered Flames）、坚岩隘谷（Tequemecan Valley）、踞石山（Coatepec Mountain）、涌流地（Toyac Springs）、翘枝崖（Quahuacan Cliff）、奥奇卡纳塔（Ochkanatlan）、安饶之野（Atocpan）、远古圣山（Ancient Sacred Mountain）、Tezcatepetonco Range与Easybreeze Holiday Resort。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前地理划分","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_natlan_geography_02","fandom_sup_natlan_geography_03","fandom_sup_natlan_geography_04","fandom_sup_natlan_geography_05","fandom_sup_natlan_geography_06","fandom_sup_natlan_geography_07","fandom_sup_natlan_geography_08","fandom_sup_natlan_geography_09","fandom_sup_natlan_geography_10"]},{"fact_id":"natgeo_fact_003","text":"万火之瓯包含Huitztli Hill与Stadium of the Sacred Flame两个子区域；后者被视为纳塔的核心地标，内部保存着持续燃烧的圣火。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_natlan_geography_03"]},{"fact_id":"natgeo_fact_004","text":"龙遗物研究协会曾勘测万火之瓯，并认为该盆地并非自然形成，而是久远以前某个巨大物体坠落的结果；坠落物的身份至今没有定论。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"勘测结论及当前认知","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_natlan_geography_03"]},{"fact_id":"natgeo_fact_005","text":"坚岩隘谷是纳塔的峡谷区域，包含「回声之子」聚落、Sulfurous Veins与Tepeacac Rise；聚落及峡谷中常回荡工匠敲击和寻猎宝石者试探岩石的声音。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_natlan_geography_01","fandom_sup_natlan_geography_04","bwiki_natlan_geography"]},{"fact_id":"natgeo_fact_006","text":"踞石山是一座高耸山峰，也是「悬木人」的居住区域；其子区域包括该部族聚落、Ancestral Temple、Firethief's Secret Isle与Teticpac Peak，其中Teticpac Peak是山顶带有小湖的高原。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_natlan_geography_01","fandom_sup_natlan_geography_05","bwiki_natlan_geography"]},{"fact_id":"natgeo_fact_007","text":"涌流地包含「流泉之众」聚落与Ameyalco Waters，以温泉和舒缓的音乐闻名，并被描述为纳塔各部族聚落中最受外来游客欢迎之处。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_natlan_geography_01","fandom_sup_natlan_geography_06","bwiki_natlan_geography"]},{"fact_id":"natgeo_fact_008","text":"翘枝崖包含「花羽会」聚落与地下洞窟Malinalco Grotto。当地后来新设了一处简易港口，用于接收并登记从Nod-Krai到来的人员。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前及近期变化","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_natlan_geography_01","fandom_sup_natlan_geography_07","bwiki_natlan_geography"]},{"fact_id":"natgeo_fact_009","text":"Tezcatepetonco Range包含「烟谜主」聚落与Tecoloapan Bay；「烟谜主」坐落于迷雾与山麓环境中，被描述为纳塔六大部族中最神秘的一支。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_natlan_geography_01","fandom_sup_natlan_geography_02","bwiki_natlan_geography"]},{"fact_id":"natgeo_fact_010","text":"奥奇卡纳塔是纳塔的一处古城遗址，位于「花羽会」北方、与其隔海相望。当地人将其视为禁忌之城；曼科还称其同时是部族人与龙遗物研究协会的禁地。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"当前认知","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_natlan_geography_08","local_sup_natlan_geography_02","local_sup_natlan_geography_04"]},{"fact_id":"natgeo_fact_011","text":"奥奇卡纳塔现存灰烬覆盖的城墟、地下城市机关遗迹及空中的托纳蒂乌；城中旧有聚落与重建邦国的尝试均已消亡或离散。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"遗址现状","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_natlan_geography_01","fandom_sup_natlan_geography_08"]},{"fact_id":"natgeo_fact_012","text":"安饶之野包含Great Volcano of Tollan与「沃陆之邦」聚落。火山灰为聚落周边带来肥沃土地；火山口上方的Skyfire Circlet由燃素力量维持悬浮，并构成通往远古圣山的唯一入口。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_natlan_geography_01","fandom_sup_natlan_geography_09","bwiki_natlan_geography"]},{"fact_id":"natgeo_fact_013","text":"远古圣山位于Great Volcano of Tollan内部，其中保存着古代龙族文明首都Sacred City of Tollan的遗迹；该区域包含议事厅、计算设施、仪式场、武器工坊、燃素池及深藏于火山内部的圣山之心等地理层级。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"远古至当前","visibility":"restricted_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_natlan_geography_01","fandom_sup_natlan_geography_10"]},{"fact_id":"natgeo_fact_014","text":"Easybreeze Holiday Resort是纳塔的沿海区域，包含市集、海崖、海湾、岛屿以及海中巨岩下形成的城镇等子区域。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_natlan_geography_01","fandom_sup_natlan_geography_02"]}],"timeline":[{"period":"远古时期","order_hint":10,"events":["古代龙族文明在Great Volcano of Tollan内部建立Sacred City of Tollan，并以其为统治纳塔的首都；该文明后来在战争中消亡。"],"current_status":"远古圣山内部仅余古城、设施与相关遗迹。","source_ids":["fandom_sup_natlan_geography_10"]},{"period":"约五百年前","order_hint":20,"events":["Great Volcano of Tollan的一次活动将一部分遗迹抛出火山，形成安饶之野Fallingstar Fields中的Tephric Ruins。"],"current_status":"被抛出的遗迹仍作为Fallingstar Fields的一部分存在。","source_ids":["fandom_sup_natlan_geography_09"]},{"period":"数十年前","order_hint":30,"events":["据玻娜所述，深渊灾厄一度摧毁其部族，盘踞奥奇卡纳塔的邪龙也在当时出现。"],"current_status":"奥奇卡纳塔仍被当地人视为受深渊浸染的禁忌古城。","source_ids":["local_sup_natlan_geography_04"]},{"period":"近期","order_hint":40,"events":["在Nod-Krai局势动荡、人员外逃增加后，翘枝崖的「花羽会」受托设立简易港口，以接收和登记到来者。"],"current_status":"该港口成为翘枝崖新增的对外接纳设施。","source_ids":["fandom_sup_natlan_geography_07"]}],"relationships":[],"in_world_visibility":{"public_summary":"纳塔居民、商旅和冒险家通常能够辨认主要部族聚落、火山、温泉、峡谷、海崖与沿海区域；奥奇卡纳塔和远古圣山内部的详细结构则明显不属于普遍知识。","likely_known_by":["纳塔各部族居民","部族长老与地方管理者","往来纳塔的商旅和冒险家","龙遗物与古代遗迹研究者"],"unlikely_known_by":["未曾到访纳塔的普通外国居民","不接触遗迹研究者所掌握的奥奇卡纳塔地下结构信息者","未经许可或缺乏相关经历者所不了解的远古圣山内部区域"],"common_beliefs_or_misconceptions":["许多冒险家曾相信托纳蒂乌是一艘满载宝物的天船；Fandom正文称这则寻宝传说实际是Kukulkan为吸引勇敢者参与其试验而散布的假传说。","龙遗物研究协会认为万火之瓯由巨大物体坠落形成，但具体坠落物仍未知，不能把某一身份解释视为定论。","有人声称Skyfire Circlet与The Upper Sanctum都是盗火贤者的手笔，但观景点正文明确将此说标为可能毫无根据的猜测。"]},"activation_keys":["纳塔主要地理区域","Major Regions of Natlan"],"excluded_material":{"gameplay_only":["区域解锁条件、任务进度门槛、地图显隐、传送与越界处理","按键、角色移动模式、龙附魂、燃素计量、伤害与生命值变化","宝箱、收集物、供奉奖励、命座效果、敌人与首领清单","任务、委托、挑战、秘境及原声曲目列表","版本发布与地图扩展等游戏更新记录"],"unsupported_or_speculative":["Toyac Springs可能取材自Pantanal的Wiki编辑者推测","Quahuacan名称可能对应某一现实语言地名的推测","Skyfire Circlet与The Upper Sanctum均由盗火贤者创造的无根据猜测","远古圣山武器工坊可能用于人体实验的未确定说法","将观景点中『一切火焰与光亮皆源于圣山』的修辞直接解释为已证实宇宙学事实"]},"sources":[{"source_id":"fandom_natlan_geography","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Viewpoint/Natlan","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Viewpoint/Natlan","language":"en","revision_id":"1859914","source_text_sha256":"dcd2a865aca2f0ec2d7915543bdb945aedec6ef76a1471c9057bcbe1a1555f72"},{"source_id":"bwiki_natlan_geography","provider":"bwiki","role":"cross_language_verification","title":"地理志纳塔","url":"https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/%E5%9C%B0%E7%90%86%E5%BF%97%E7%BA%B3%E5%A1%94","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"613950","source_text_sha256":"921438922dbc214ac10591952232536cfdb3082fecf113357b27675b74264100"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_natlan_geography_01","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Viewpoint/Natlan","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Viewpoint/Natlan","language":"en","revision_id":"1859914","source_text_sha256":"b277820fd403e3cac35a75b9569dc62c51b56b704cc33865cea21b070e3d597b"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_natlan_geography_02","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Natlan","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Natlan","language":"en","revision_id":"2135331","source_text_sha256":"c47fba85c07f8e32a943179a9d86391ca6cfdfd2c8a3c159a3f29e7b2a0be1f4"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_natlan_geography_03","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Basin of Unnumbered Flames","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Basin_of_Unnumbered_Flames","language":"en","revision_id":"2105727","source_text_sha256":"5d6cdaf2a07b2b14d51f8e65837786979c5bb18716e2a315f38b533d6c85a0fd"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_natlan_geography_04","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Tequemecan Valley","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Tequemecan_Valley","language":"en","revision_id":"2105728","source_text_sha256":"fb3bd9587e75c888c5eee4f5132da7200e3ae15f1e69829820be90a995a0c62f"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_natlan_geography_05","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Coatepec Mountain","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Coatepec_Mountain","language":"en","revision_id":"2105726","source_text_sha256":"9f21c7b930a6e3feab1e920c65bb769e13a957ce7d992c897dcf7655de096de1"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_natlan_geography_06","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Toyac Springs","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Toyac_Springs","language":"en","revision_id":"2134928","source_text_sha256":"cf7212f00323d286205d8a32879878211696b4926c7385ad2013b544863a84bb"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_natlan_geography_07","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Quahuacan Cliff","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Quahuacan_Cliff","language":"en","revision_id":"1888293","source_text_sha256":"9db929a43af1166bdc851cd116432bb862ef4bef057a335a693aa1b4ae1f23ea"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_natlan_geography_08","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Ochkanatlan","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Ochkanatlan","language":"en","revision_id":"2074316","source_text_sha256":"476fd6c8f80441bb805a06be03c2d64398c03c05b788cccf910307721b45687c"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_natlan_geography_09","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Atocpan","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Atocpan","language":"en","revision_id":"2105755","source_text_sha256":"0ffb1a417254e9caab66db9c91309dd2ef2a4c058474446ec3fe1284d9d049a0"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_natlan_geography_10","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Ancient Sacred Mountain","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Ancient_Sacred_Mountain","language":"en","revision_id":"2089466","source_text_sha256":"85857258dde0ad98a1ad76b0c98ba3410a2ffa4d569a5c51f948e6e64bfa20d0"},{"source_id":"local_sup_natlan_geography_02","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"将行之路","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_75008.json#unit=7500801","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"7767a447bc6e76e4db0c8bf830d4a822eed3d121740594d43db0d56f1e7e8a00"},{"source_id":"local_sup_natlan_geography_04","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"翻越朝霭之墙","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_75048.json#unit=7504816","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"1c53811099a873b54d36316c1583099cc8d27814113e28f8411bf0e7f875ae63"}],"evidence_bundle_sha256":"45925c9cf67e58eb3f8936f5fb4c0136ead222aff656a61ea7ef81a0a6ab9796","review":{"cross_language_conflicts":[],"uncertain_claims":["万火之瓯的撞击成因是龙遗物研究协会的勘测结论，坠落物身份未知。","奥奇卡纳塔数十年前遭遇深渊灾厄及邪龙出现的时间关系来自玻娜的陈述。","关于托纳蒂乌满载宝物的说法在世界内广为流传，但Fandom正文明确称其为人为散布的假传说。"],"missing_evidence":["证据包未提供Tezcatepetonco Range与Easybreeze Holiday Resort的中文正式区域名核验，因此卡中保留英文名。","证据包没有这两个区域的独立Fandom区域页；其主要层级与地貌概述只能依据纳塔总页和观景点汇总正文整理。"],"needs_human_review":true}}